# Declarative Lola Package Specification (.lola-req)
#
# Configures Lola AI Package Manager (lola-ai) for sovereign, air-gapped skill resolution.
# Local vendored paths under .agents/skills/ serve as primary resolution targets,
# with sovereign Git remotes (self-hosted Gitea/GitLab) supported as fallbacks.
# ==============================================================================

